            "description": {
              "value": "Your skin glows with intensity. Creatures within 10 feet who can see you must succeed at a Fortitude save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature is blinded for 1 round and dazzled for 4 rounds.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is blinded for 4 rounds and dazzled for 10 minutes."
